    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New and changed companies\n\n**Trigger On** is set to *New and Updated Records*. That mode only exists for the resources that carry `updated_at`: companies, projects, products and services, tasks, tracked time and bank transactions.\n\n**Invoices, estimates and vouchers do not have the field**, so there the trigger only sees new records, and the option is not offered at all.\n\nThe first poll after activating only remembers where \"now\" is and fires nothing. That is deliberate: otherwise switching the workflow on would run the whole account through it.\n\nEvery poll spends API credits from the account's monthly budget, even when it finds nothing. Hourly is usually plenty for master data.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 420
      },
